Node ID=33 Test of Bravery
Text=It so happens I have just the task! A filthy beggar named Felgnash - may all the devils in hell dog his steps until his dying day - has stolen a sword from me, a sword fashioned by my father, no less! The coward has fled into the sewers, no doubt in fear of the beating he would receive at my hands!
Should Have Voiceover=1

